cicada studio [score.cicada] [--listen 127.0.0.1:port] [--audio tymbal|oto|null] [--lsp-stdio]

open the local workstation

Flags:
  --listen <addr>  loopback address; default 127.0.0.1:0
  --audio <name>   select tymbal, oto, or null
  --lsp-stdio      serve LSP on stdin/stdout and Studio on stderr
  --help           show this help

CICADA_AUDIO selects the backend when --audio is omitted. Tymbal is the default on Windows and Linux; oto is the macOS default. Use --audio oto to select oto explicitly.
